\fs26 The Ulyssian Defence Force Lawn Rangers had already spent several hours being attacked by Elvi in elderly love cars with stage equipment, stolen Gyges discs and karate. Several vehicles had ceased to be where their commanders had originally put them. One communications truck had lost an aerial to a thrown disc; an armoured carrier wore somebody\'92s scarf; and the space beyond the Sublime Point gates was littered with the remains of an offensive which had combined guerrilla warfare with the logistical habits of a touring band.\
Near the gates, another platoon of Elvi was still setting up amplifiers.
